The GitHub Copilot Coding Agent section of the README was missing two fields required by that host's MCP format.

## Changes

- **`README.md`** — updated the Copilot Coding Agent snippet to include:
  - `"type": "local"` — required by Copilot Coding Agent to identify the server as a locally-spawned stdio process
  - `"tools": ["*"]` — without this the agent receives no tools from the server

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "msgraph-kb": {
      "type": "local",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "github:UniverseCitiz3n/msgraph-kb-mcp"],
      "tools": ["*"]
    }
  }
}
```

